      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nakalusia naboola mbu Nebutswa, lola, shibakhafuchiilile kata okhuhulila okhuboola khwanje ta; shichila bakhasunje mbu OMWAMI shiyakhulolesheele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namureeba ari Nishiina eshia oli ninashio mumukhono eshio? Nakalusia mbu Neindabushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasunga mbu 'Chifuube hasi. Musa nachifuuba hasi, niyikwa inzokha; mana nachiilukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Nyiila omukhonokwo ochitiile omushila. Naye nanyiila omukhono, nachitiila, niyikwa indabushi mumukhonokwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana basuubile shinga olwa OMWAMI, Nyasaye waAburahamu, Nyasaye waIsaka, khandi Nyasaye waYakobo, yakhulolesheele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nameeta namusunjila mbu Khandi ra omukhono mungubo khushilifushio. Naye nara omukhonokwe khushilifu; nolwa yakurusia, lola, omukhonokwe kwali nikulikhwo obuchele, nikulabile tserelele shinga itsaluchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye nasunga mbu Kalusia omukhono khushilifushio. Naye nakalusia omukhonokwe khushilifu; nolwa yakurusia khushilifushie, lola, kwali nikukalukhaane khandi shinga omubilikwe kwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye naboola mbu Ne nibaba nibakhaya okhukhufuchiilila, kata okhurechelesia akeshilolelo shiambeli, bakhasuubile akeshilolelo shiolunyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nibaba nibarasuubila kata ebilolelo bino bibili, kata okhuhulila okhuboolakhwo ta, otahekhwo khumatsi akomumwalo kwaNaili, okasundule khwiloba eliumu; namatsi ako aka otayile okhurula mumwalo kwaNaili kalakwa amabanga khushialo eshiumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Musa namusunjila OMWAMI ari O, Omwami, isie shindi owolulimi olwangu tawe, kata okhurula khale, kata bulaano olwa osungaane nende omusumbawo; okhuba shindi omwangu okhuboola ta; olulimi lwanje nolusiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila ari Niwina owalonga omunwa kwomundu? Kata niwina oukhola omundu abe omusilu, kata oweekala amarwi, kata owokhulola, kata omubofu? Shindi nisie OMWAMI? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano tsia, nasi ndalabeetsanga halala nende omunwakwo, nikhwibaalila aka witsa okhuboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nasunga mbu O, Omwami, ekhusaaya mbu orumile mumukhono kwa oyo owa wenya okhuruma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oburima bwOMWAMI bwamwashila Musa, nasunga mbu Shialiyo Haruni omwana weenywe, omuLawi? Emanyile mbu ye anyala okhuboola bulayi. Khandi lola, arulile, yeetsanga okhukhwakaanila; olwa alakhulola, yeetsa okhusangaala mumwoyokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe olamuboolelangakhwo, nomwechesia amakhuwa aka akhoyile okhuboola; nasi ndalabeetsanga halala nende omunwakwo, khandi nende omunwakwe, nimwechesia aka mukhoyile okhukhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alabeetsanga omusunjiwo imbeli wabandu; ye alakhubeelanga shinga omunwakwo, nawe olabeetsanga khuye shinga Nyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi olatsia nende indabushi yino mumukhono, eya nokholelenje ebilolelo ebio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa yakalukha eMisiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa natsia, nakalukha ewaYetsero nyakhufialanyene, namusunjila ari Chama ofuchiilile enzie engalushe ewabaana beefwe abali muMisiri, endole nibaba nibashiliyo mwoyo. Yetsero namusunjila Musa ari Otsie nomulembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ebweneyo eMidiani, mbu Tsia okalushe eMisiri; okhuba abandu bosi abali nibayiimanga obulamubwo bamala okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Musa nabukula omukhasiwe nende abaanabe abasiani, nabaniinia khusishili, nakalukha mushialo shiaMisiri; Musa natsia neindabushi yaNyasaye mumukhono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Olwa wakhabe nokaluushe eMisiri, orachweya okhukhola imbeli waFarao amakana ako kosi aka ndareele mumukhonokwo tawe; nebutswa ndalatinyia omwoyokwe, naye shialalekhuula abandu batsie ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omusunjile Farao ori Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Isiraeli niye omwana wanje, nomwikulanda wanje; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasi emalile okhukhusunjila mbu Lekhuula omwana wanje atsie, mbu yakhalabanile; nawe wakhayile okhumulekhuula; lola, enzitsa okhwira omwana wuwo, omwikulandawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khunjila, habundu ewa bakona, OMWAMI yaakaana ninaye, niyeenya okhumwira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Zipora yabukula lichina limemu, nasheba likhoba lielifunga liomwanawe, nalifuuba habilenje biaMusa; nasunga mbu Toto, oli omusaatsa weshitsayi khwisie! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI namulekha. Nilwo olwa yaboola mbu Oli omusaatsa weshitsayi, mbu khulwa eshishebo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI yamusunjila Haruni ari Otsie mushitsiimi okhumwakaanila Musa. Naye natsia, niyaakaana ninaye mushikulu shiaNyasaye, namufumbeelela namutsunzuuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Musa namuboolela haruni amakhuwa kosi kOMWAMI, aka yali namurumile ninako, nende ebilolelo biosi ebia yali niyamulachilisia.",
